(7456122, 1181299, 97225, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tanguera:</b></div><hr/><i> I''m so curious about that vase. Or object d''art. Because as a vase it would suck :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The vase is a failed student piece. My daughter made it whilst at college. She wanted to throw it out years ago but I liked the shape and held onto it. Originally it was yellow, white and purple striped and badly smudged, as well as having slumped during firing. I spray painted it black, but I''m annoyed with myself for not photographing it first. (Oh, and I have plenty of nice things she made too.)</td>', 'Originally posted by tanguera: I''m so curious about that vase. Or object d''art. Because as a vase it would suck :)   The vase is a failed student piece. My daughter made it whilst at college. She wanted to throw it out years ago but I liked the shape and held onto it. Originally it was yellow, white and purple striped and badly smudged, as well as having slumped during firing. I spray painted it black, but I''m annoyed with myself for not photographing it first. (Oh, and I have plenty of nice things she made too.)', '2016-05-23 02:28:30.000000', NULL, 0),
