(7456475, 1181270, 128323, '<td valign="top">What a great idea and perfect processing!  One of the rare photos that make me keep coming back to this place.  Great shot, congrats on a well-deserved blue!</td>', 'What a great idea and perfect processing!  One of the rare photos that make me keep coming back to this place.  Great shot, congrats on a well-deserved blue!', '2016-05-24 20:26:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(7456578, 1181275, 124815, '<td valign="top">It''s a heroic image. It brought to my mind the feel of a painting: Altorfer''s "The Battle of Alexander at Issus" - it''s not painterly, it''s the very thing when you closed your eyes and the scene remained reflected on your retina. And, ha, I normally do not favor this type of processing which makes your picture even more important: a historic shot</td>', 'It''s a heroic image. It brought to my mind the feel of a painting: Altorfer''s "The Battle of Alexander at Issus" - it''s not painterly, it''s the very thing when you closed your eyes and the scene remained reflected on your retina. And, ha, I normally do not favor this type of processing which makes your picture even more important: a historic shot', '2016-05-25 01:51:41.000000', NULL, 0),
