(7456797, 1181197, 113591, '<td valign="top">Ach, it pains me when the obvious isn''t obvious to others.<br/> <br/>What do they see, I wonder. Or is my brain twisted enough that I see things that are not there? <br/> <br/>Enough about me, although I am quite important, as I am the viewer, am I not..hehe.  Moving on to the image, it''s such a contemplative-inducing image. How to resolve a power struggle amicably. How time sorts out problems. How pretty a forced change can turn out.</td>', 'Ach, it pains me when the obvious isn''t obvious to others. What do they see, I wonder. Or is my brain twisted enough that I see things that are not there?  Enough about me, although I am quite important, as I am the viewer, am I not..hehe.  Moving on to the image, it''s such a contemplative-inducing image. How to resolve a power struggle amicably. How time sorts out problems. How pretty a forced change can turn out.', '2016-05-26 03:26:11.000000', NULL, 0),
